==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|syngje}} (e infinitive)
* {{l|nn|synga}}, {{l|nn|synge}} (also Norwegian Bokmål)

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{m|non|syngja}}, {{m|non|syngva}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nn}} {{m|gem-pro|*singwaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|nn}} {{m|ine-pro|*sengʷh-}}. Akin to {{cog|en|sing}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/²sʏŋːjɑ/|lang=no}}

===Verb===
{{nn-verb-irreg|syng|song|sunge}}

# [[sing]]
#: ''Eg har ikkje '''sunge''' denne songen på årevis.''
#:: I haven't '''sung''' this song for years.
# [[echo]], [[boom]]

